     Surojit Sarkar, Swapan Kr Dey, Gouriprosad Datta, Amit Bandyopadhyay
     PMC10323915 · Sports Medicine and Health Science · 2023-04-03
     https://doi.org/10.1016/j.smhs.2023.03.006
     "This study investigated the effects of vitamin C and E supplementation on high-intensity interval training (HIIT) in young males. Supplementation protected against negative hematological changes and improved lipid profiles and explosive strength without affecting endurance."

